Auto-attach (feature, ON by default — toggle with --feature/--no-feature):
  File paths in the message text that resolve to an existing file (absolute,
  ~-expanded, or relative to the current directory) are auto-attached: images
  become photos, everything else becomes a document. The path token is KEPT in
  the caption (it is NOT removed). Explicit --photo/--file take precedence.
  Disable with --no-feature auto-attach or features.auto-attach: false in
  ~/.config/tg-cli/config.yaml.

Autolink tasks (feature, ON by default — toggle with --feature/--no-feature):
  Ticket-like codes in the text (3 uppercase letters + dash + digits, e.g.
  HYP-576) are verified via the linear CLI and linked to their Linear issues.
  One ticket: its title is added to the first line. Several: a collapsed
  reference block (code: title) is appended. Codes Linear doesn't know are
